# L §4.6 step 1: "a range whose ends are out of order is refused at load, LOAD-KEY".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

index ns = 1..80
input x[n in ns]: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x[60..1] = 2
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY ...
